  "hints": [
    "Start with the case and the motherboard; the bench checks every later part against them.",
    "The Ryzen 5 7600 needs an AM5 board, which takes DDR5 DIMMs (not SO-DIMMs).",
    "The RTX 4060 draws 115 W; with the CPU, board, memory and drive the build needs about 230 W, so the 350 W supply is enough with headroom. The RX 7900 XT would need the 650 W unit and does not fit the case anyway."
